  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed both as a noun and as a suru verb ({回顧|かいこ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧). Commonly appears in cultural contexts — {回顧|かいこ}⟦{展|てん}→〜展：28468_ten⟧ (retrospective exhibition) is a standard compound. Also used in {回顧|かいこ}{録|ろく} (memoir, reminiscences).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {回顧|かいこ}⟦{展|てん}→〜展：28468_ten⟧: retrospective exhibition\n- {回顧|かいこ}{録|ろく}: memoir, reminiscences\n- ⟦{過去|かこ}→過去：00152_kako⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{回顧|かいこ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to look back on the past\n- ⟦{一年|いちねん}→一年：10994_ichinen⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{回顧|かいこ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to look back on the year",
